<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/29831f1a-d18f-4fa5-84f1-03a79c4b02c1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Implement full datatype reasoning (dt-type2, dt-eq, dt-diff) now" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/29831f1a-d18f-4fa5-84f1-03a79c4b02c1> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/29831f1a-d18f-4fa5-84f1-03a79c4b02c1> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Alternative rejected in commit cd5cee9a68: implementing all five dt-* rules now, rather than only dt-type1 and dt-not-type, was considered and rejected -- the README states dt-eq and dt-diff are excluded because \"even owlrl skips\" them, and dt-type2 is called out as requiring \"non-standard literal-as-subject triples\" -- so only the two dt-* rules with clear practical value were implemented." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/29831f1a-d18f-4fa5-84f1-03a79c4b02c1> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
