<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/408e1ee3-f208-458d-bc46-c7a0c3be13e2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Pass delta-add's Delta as (Ptr Delta) to mutate in place: rejected because every caller threads the returned Delta via set!, so a local mut copy keeps the existing functional-update contract with no call-site churn." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/408e1ee3-f208-458d-bc46-c7a0c3be13e2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
