<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/13efe180-385a-497d-9c3f-feaacc834a6f> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/13efe180-385a-497d-9c3f-feaacc834a6f> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Growl is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Evidence: this commit adds a full 201-line Apache-2.0 LICENSE file at the repo root (LICENSE), and the newly-added README.md's closing \"License\" section states \"Apache License 2.0 - see [LICENSE](LICENSE) for details.\" This is the first codification of growl's distribution license; no prior license file or statement existed in the repo." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
