<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/191a4dc2-7833-4fe9-918e-26cf5d936c19> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/191a4dc2-7833-4fe9-918e-26cf5d936c19> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Stream graph matches via indexed-graph-for-each" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/191a4dc2-7833-4fe9-918e-26cf5d936c19> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/365040dc-aee8-456c-936c-47a7dbb4c79b> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/191a4dc2-7833-4fe9-918e-26cf5d936c19> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/7a377274-e1bc-43a2-b657-8ae3e39fdefb> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/191a4dc2-7833-4fe9-918e-26cf5d936c19> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/191a4dc2-7833-4fe9-918e-26cf5d936c19> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "A new callback-based iteration primitive, indexed-graph-for-each, now replaces indexed-graph-match + for-each at growl's hottest match sites, so a matching triple is delivered to a callback one at a time instead of first being materialized as a full arena-allocated List<Triple>. Evidence: commit 75b17fd (\"significant fixes for memory issues\") diff — engine.slop's import list gains indexed-graph-for-each alongside the existing indexed-graph-match, and engine-run-iteration-0's delta seed changes from `(for-each (t (indexed-graph-match arena g (none) (none) (none))) (set! d (delta-add arena d t)))` to `(indexed-graph-for-each g (none) (none) (none) (fn ((t Triple)) (set! d (delta-add arena d t))))`. src/rules/cax.slop rewrites cax-sco (both directions) and cax-eqc1/cax-eqc2 the same way; src/rules/cls.slop rewrites cls-int1, cls-int2, cls-uni1, cls-svf1, cls-avf1, and cls-hv1 the same way. The switch is selective, not blanket: cax.slop's cax-dw and cax-adc functions, and other indexed-graph-match call sites, are left unchanged (only local binding names were renamed to avoid shadowing) — the rewrite targets specifically the call sites that were driving memory growth." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/191a4dc2-7833-4fe9-918e-26cf5d936c19> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/191a4dc2-7833-4fe9-918e-26cf5d936c19> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-02-04T23:49:15Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
