<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/1b825e8a-67a1-4309-9089-03932d1946cb> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/1b825e8a-67a1-4309-9089-03932d1946cb> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Annotation property filtering as reasoner preprocessing" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/1b825e8a-67a1-4309-9089-03932d1946cb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/8ca604ea-a005-4f94-b503-8e24484d3589> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/1b825e8a-67a1-4309-9089-03932d1946cb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/9f7a7679-6c17-40b2-bbef-b78d9832bfa1> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/1b825e8a-67a1-4309-9089-03932d1946cb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/e71422b6-0c80-4741-aa68-a27243061168> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/1b825e8a-67a1-4309-9089-03932d1946cb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/1b825e8a-67a1-4309-9089-03932d1946cb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Growl now strips annotation-property triples out of the graph before it's converted to an IndexedGraph and reasoned over, then re-adds them only when the CLI serializes an --emit output -- because annotation properties (labels, comments, provenance/versioning metadata) have no semantic effect under OWL 2 Direct Semantics and cannot trigger any OWL 2 RL inference rule, so removing them shrinks the reasoner's input without changing results.\n\nWhy + evidence: commit 587abe2735 (merge PR #10 \"filter_annotations\", \"add annotation filtering\"). A new collect-annotation-properties (arena, graph) -> Set<Term> function (src/filter.slop, C entry point growl_collect_annotation_properties in new csrc/src/slop_filter.c) builds the filter set from a default list of 27 well-known annotation properties -- 9 OWL/RDFS (rdfs:label, rdfs:comment, rdfs:seeAlso, rdfs:isDefinedBy, owl:deprecated, owl:versionInfo, owl:priorVersion, owl:backwardCompatibleWith, owl:incompatibleWith), 10 SKOS (prefLabel, altLabel, hiddenLabel, definition, note, scopeNote, example, historyNote, editorialNote, changeNote), 8 Dublin Core/DCTERMS (dc:title/creator/subject/description, dcterms:title/creator/description/abstract) -- plus any property the input graph itself declares via `?p rdf:type owl:AnnotationProperty`. README.md's new \"Annotation Filtering\" section states this drops CCO's input from ~13.6K to ~6K triples.\n\ngraph-to-indexed and indexed-to-graph move out of cli/main.slop (which previously defined them locally, per \"Direct record-new construction for IndexedGraph-to-Graph conversion\") into the new growl library module src/filter.slop, re-exported through growl.slop; graph-to-indexed gains a new `annot-set (Set Term)` parameter so any caller (not just the CLI) can skip annotation triples while building the IndexedGraph fed to the fixpoint engine, while indexed-to-graph itself is unchanged (still the direct record-new construction). cli/main.slop's --emit path re-adds the filtered triples from the parsed graph before calling indexed-to-graph, so no data is lost in the materialized output; its non-quiet summary line also now prints a \"(filtered N annotations)\" count." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/1b825e8a-67a1-4309-9089-03932d1946cb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/1b825e8a-67a1-4309-9089-03932d1946cb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-02-09T21:10:21Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
