<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/22236670-0164-45f9-8215-180a9b64b730> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/22236670-0164-45f9-8215-180a9b64b730> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Toolchain-free `make lib` target for libgrowl.a" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/22236670-0164-45f9-8215-180a9b64b730> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/74af8f69-d68a-4db6-a495-07bb196e4866> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/22236670-0164-45f9-8215-180a9b64b730> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/9f7a7679-6c17-40b2-bbef-b78d9832bfa1> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/22236670-0164-45f9-8215-180a9b64b730> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/22236670-0164-45f9-8215-180a9b64b730> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "The Makefile gains a `lib` target that archives all shared growl C sources into build/libgrowl.a via $(AR) rcs, packaging growl as a static library directly from the pre-transpiled csrc/ sources with no SLOP toolchain involved — extending the existing toolchain-free CLI/test/release build (see \"Toolchain-free C build for growl\") to library packaging as well. Evidence: Makefile diff adds `AR ?= ar`, `OBJ = $(BIN)/obj`, `SHARED_OBJS := $(patsubst $(CSRC)/%.c,$(OBJ)/%.o,$(SHARED_SRCS))`, a `$(OBJ)/%.o: $(CSRC)/%.c` pattern rule, and `lib: $(BIN)/libgrowl.a` / `$(BIN)/libgrowl.a: $(SHARED_OBJS) | $(BIN); $(AR) rcs $@ $^`; README.md documents `make lib # build static library → build/libgrowl.a`." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/22236670-0164-45f9-8215-180a9b64b730> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/22236670-0164-45f9-8215-180a9b64b730> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-02-09T00:26:48Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/22236670-0164-45f9-8215-180a9b64b730> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Toolchain-free `make lib` target for libgrowl.a" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/22236670-0164-45f9-8215-180a9b64b730> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#resultsIn> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/ca742dbb-57b5-4fba-930e-e3ff927faab6> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/22e3b476-7acb-4dfb-a5c9-913ebd6ab8b8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/22e3b476-7acb-4dfb-a5c9-913ebd6ab8b8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Adopt RDF 1.2 quoted triple terms from slop-rdf" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/22e3b476-7acb-4dfb-a5c9-913ebd6ab8b8> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/74af8f69-d68a-4db6-a495-07bb196e4866> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/22e3b476-7acb-4dfb-a5c9-913ebd6ab8b8> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/833a482a-9217-4511-99e7-1166a8c28fbb> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/22e3b476-7acb-4dfb-a5c9-913ebd6ab8b8> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/22e3b476-7acb-4dfb-a5c9-913ebd6ab8b8> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Growl's core `rdf_Term` type gains a fourth variant, `term_triple` (a boxed `rdf_Triple*`), for RDF 1.2 / RDF-star-style quoted triple terms, pulled in by bumping the slop-rdf dependency; the TTL parser gains `<<( s p o )>>` triple-term syntax and `{| ... |}` annotation/reification syntax (emitting `rdf:reifies` triples), and the TTL serializer gains a matching entry point to write triple terms back out.\n\nWhy + evidence: commit 9a54ad238d (\"update slop-rdf version\") regenerates csrc/'s transpiled C from a new slop-rdf release — the external RDF/TTL library growl vendors via slop.toml's `../slop-rdf` build include (growl's own src/ tree has no rdf.slop or ttl.slop; confirmed via `git ls-tree` at this commit). slop_rdf.h adds `rdf_TermKind_triple`/`rdf_Term_term_triple` and `rdf_Term rdf_make_triple_term(slop_arena*, rdf_Triple)`; slop_rdf.c implements it and extends `rdf_term_eq`/`rdf_term_free` with a `term_triple` arm. Every generated `slop_hash_rdf_Term`/`slop_eq_rdf_Term` pair across slop_engine.h, slop_filter.h, slop_index.h, and slop_types.h (7 duplicate sites total, consistent with growl's existing generated-monomorphization pattern) gains a matching `case rdf_Term_term_triple` arm. slop_ttl.c/h add `ttl_parse_triple_term`/`ttl_expect_triple_term_close` (parses `<<( subj pred obj )>>`, wired into `ttl_parse_term_extended` on seeing `<<(`) and `ttl_parse_annotation` (parses `{| ... |}` after a triple, emitting `(reifier rdf:reifies <<(base_triple)>>)`); slop_serialize_ttl.c/h add `serialize_ttl_serialize_triple_term`. In lockstep, slop.toml's `[project].version` moves 0.4.0 → 0.5.2 and rust/Cargo.toml's crate version moves 0.5.1 → 0.5.2, though no growl-authored .slop source changed in this commit." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/22e3b476-7acb-4dfb-a5c9-913ebd6ab8b8> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/22e3b476-7acb-4dfb-a5c9-913ebd6ab8b8> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-06-26T02:39:08Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
