<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2dedc0f9-53f1-4331-afd1-da069c898528> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "OWL 2 RL rule coverage completion" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2dedc0f9-53f1-4331-afd1-da069c898528> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/365040dc-aee8-456c-936c-47a7dbb4c79b> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2dedc0f9-53f1-4331-afd1-da069c898528> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2dedc0f9-53f1-4331-afd1-da069c898528> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Growl's OWL 2 RL rule implementation reaches 70 of 78 rules (90%) across Tables 4-9, with datatype reasoning (Table 8, dt-*, 0/5) and three individual rules (prp-ap, cls-thing, cls-nothing1) deliberately left unimplemented, rather than pursued to 100%.\n\nWhy + evidence: commit d26d5120 (merge PR #3 \"Completing\") rewrites README.md's Rule Coverage section from an untracked-coverage table (Tables 4-8, no per-rule status) to a detailed per-rule status table (Tables 4-9, ✅/❌) claiming eq-* 9/9, prp-* 19/20, cls-* 17/19, cax-* 5/5, dt-* 0/5, scm-* 20/20 = 70/78 (90%). The README gives explicit rationale for each exclusion: prp-ap \"Annotation properties — no useful inference\"; cls-thing \"Skipped — triple explosion (every resource gets type owl:Thing)\"; cls-nothing1 \"Skipped — scm-cls already handles\"; all five dt-* rules \"no datatype reasoning\". The README's \"Fast Mode\" skip-list is also widened to add prp-adp, prp-npa1, prp-npa2, cls-maxqc1/2, and cls-maxqc3/4 to the rules `--fast` bypasses — these were absent from the previous fast-mode skip list, indicating they are newly implemented in this PR alongside the coverage-table claim that Table 5 (prp-*) and Table 6 (cls-*) are now at 19/20 and 17/19 respectively." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2dedc0f9-53f1-4331-afd1-da069c898528> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "superseded" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
