<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4ad1543a-b52a-4caa-9752-ca7ee85f7e8a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4ad1543a-b52a-4caa-9752-ca7ee85f7e8a> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CLI reports TTL parse error line/column" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4ad1543a-b52a-4caa-9752-ca7ee85f7e8a> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/e71422b6-0c80-4741-aa68-a27243061168> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4ad1543a-b52a-4caa-9752-ca7ee85f7e8a> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4ad1543a-b52a-4caa-9752-ca7ee85f7e8a> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "cli/main.slop's parse-failure branch now matches on the `TtlFileError` union returned by parse-ttl-file: a `(parse-error pe)` arm prints the 1-based line and column from `(. pe position)` plus `(. pe message)`, and a `(file-error _)` arm prints a generic \"(file error)\" line — replacing the prior behavior of printing only \"Error: failed to parse <path>\" with no further detail regardless of failure cause. Evidence: commit 10f2845884 diff on cli/main.slop — the import list gains `(import common (ParseError Position))` and `TtlFileError` from `ttl`, and the `((error e) ...)` arm of the parse-ttl-file match gains the nested `(match e ((parse-error pe) ...) ((file-error _) ...))` block." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4ad1543a-b52a-4caa-9752-ca7ee85f7e8a> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4ad1543a-b52a-4caa-9752-ca7ee85f7e8a> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-02-07T04:53:15Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4ad1543a-b52a-4caa-9752-ca7ee85f7e8a> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "CLI reports TTL parse error line/column" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4ad1543a-b52a-4caa-9752-ca7ee85f7e8a> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#resultsIn> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/c1315e16-f15d-423d-bfc7-56235eeacfee> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4b6d6551-ddbc-4602-b3c2-84b4e77e2918> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4b6d6551-ddbc-4602-b3c2-84b4e77e2918> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Use hash Set for O(1) Delta deduplication" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4b6d6551-ddbc-4602-b3c2-84b4e77e2918> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/7a377274-e1bc-43a2-b657-8ae3e39fdefb> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4b6d6551-ddbc-4602-b3c2-84b4e77e2918> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/bfddb2b9-baed-4f0a-a841-6ce6ff4c9dc0> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4b6d6551-ddbc-4602-b3c2-84b4e77e2918> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4b6d6551-ddbc-4602-b3c2-84b4e77e2918> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Delta's dedup check in delta-add (src/types.slop) now uses a Set<Triple> field (\"seen\") for O(1) membership testing instead of an O(n) linear scan comparing every existing triple with triple-eq. The Delta record gains a new `seen (Set Triple)` field alongside `triples (List Triple)`; delta-add calls set-has/set-put instead of looping with for-each + triple-eq. The module comment now reads \"Uses Set for O(1) deduplication instead of O(n) list scan\" and delta-add's own comment says \"O(1) lookup using hash set instead of O(n) list scan\". Evidence: commit c12cd0ed (\"getting bfo test working\") diff on src/types.slop, in the same commit that adds the BFO-2020 ontology (~600+ triples materializing far more via fixpoint iteration) as a CLI integration test fixture — the O(n) scan was tractable for small unit-test fixtures but not at that scale." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4b6d6551-ddbc-4602-b3c2-84b4e77e2918> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4b6d6551-ddbc-4602-b3c2-84b4e77e2918> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-02-03T15:29:45Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4b6d6551-ddbc-4602-b3c2-84b4e77e2918> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Use hash Set for O(1) Delta deduplication" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4b6d6551-ddbc-4602-b3c2-84b4e77e2918> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#resultsIn> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/8a3e51d7-690e-437f-b81e-e0d674416c2e> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4b6d6551-ddbc-4602-b3c2-84b4e77e2918> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/1097779b-3dee-4e7c-88d8-cb1ed0d8c006> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4c63dce6-c21e-49fc-a5e1-0d64b5a9c005> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4c63dce6-c21e-49fc-a5e1-0d64b5a9c005> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Predicate-indexed Delta lookup for rule matching" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4c63dce6-c21e-49fc-a5e1-0d64b5a9c005> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/365040dc-aee8-456c-936c-47a7dbb4c79b> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4c63dce6-c21e-49fc-a5e1-0d64b5a9c005> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/bfddb2b9-baed-4f0a-a841-6ce6ff4c9dc0> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4c63dce6-c21e-49fc-a5e1-0d64b5a9c005> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4c63dce6-c21e-49fc-a5e1-0d64b5a9c005> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Delta gains a new `by-predicate (Map Term (Set Triple))` field (src/types.slop), populated incrementally inside delta-add alongside the existing `triples` list and `seen` set, and every OWL 2 RL rule-module match site across cax.slop, cls.slop, eq.slop, prp.slop, and scm.slop that previously scanned the full `(. delta triples)` list with a `(when (term-eq (triple-predicate dt) X) ...)` filter now does `(match (map-get (. delta by-predicate) X) ((some pred-triples) (for-each (dt pred-triples) ...)) ((none) (do)))` instead. This replaces an O(delta size) linear scan-and-filter on every rule invocation with an O(1) map lookup that yields only the already-predicate-matched subset, applied as a uniform mechanical rewrite across dozens of rule functions (cax-sco, cax-eqc1/2, cax-dw, cls-nothing2, cls-int1/2, cls-uni1, cls-com, cls-svf1, cls-hv1, cls-avf1, eq-sym, eq-trans, eq-rep-s/p/o, prp-dom, prp-rng, and the scm-* schema-vocabulary rules, among others).\n\nEvidence: commit 10bc6356 (merge of PR #2, \"performance\", merging ee866f6) diff — src/types.slop's Delta record gains `(by-predicate (Map Term (Set Triple)))`; delta-add gains a block populating it via `map-has`/`map-put`/`map-get`/`set-put`; src/rules/{cax,cls,eq,prp,scm}.slop each replace linear `for-each` + `term-eq` predicate filters with `match (map-get (. delta by-predicate) pred) ...`." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4c63dce6-c21e-49fc-a5e1-0d64b5a9c005> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4c63dce6-c21e-49fc-a5e1-0d64b5a9c005> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-02-06T18:09:05Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
