<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8afd2e38-3664-402e-9dbd-30a634c91dc3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Semi-naive delta-based fixpoint evaluation (no redundant post-round filter)" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8afd2e38-3664-402e-9dbd-30a634c91dc3> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/7a377274-e1bc-43a2-b657-8ae3e39fdefb> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8afd2e38-3664-402e-9dbd-30a634c91dc3> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8afd2e38-3664-402e-9dbd-30a634c91dc3> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "The engine's main loop (engine-run / engine-run-iteration / apply-all-rules in src/engine.slop) still applies rules only against the current Delta of newly-derived triples each iteration -- semi-naive Datalog-style evaluation, not a full re-scan of the accumulated graph -- and still terminates at a fixpoint (empty delta) or config.max-iterations, but no longer runs a second post-round pass to filter combined results against the graph. That filtering is now solely the responsibility of (a) each rule function's own indexed-graph-contains check before pushing to its result list, and (b) delta-add's O(1) `seen`-set dedup when merging per-rule results into the iteration's combined Delta. types.slop's Delta comment still frames this as \"Designed for future extension to differential dataflow.\"" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8afd2e38-3664-402e-9dbd-30a634c91dc3> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8afd2e38-3664-402e-9dbd-30a634c91dc3> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasRationale> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/ab9b411c-1728-4d76-bc00-982407f0eb84> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8afd2e38-3664-402e-9dbd-30a634c91dc3> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-02-06T18:09:05Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
