<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8fef3fb8-4281-4f7a-90f3-66558fd98861> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8fef3fb8-4281-4f7a-90f3-66558fd98861> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Include src/rules in Z3 verify scope" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8fef3fb8-4281-4f7a-90f3-66558fd98861> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/365040dc-aee8-456c-936c-47a7dbb4c79b> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8fef3fb8-4281-4f7a-90f3-66558fd98861> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8fef3fb8-4281-4f7a-90f3-66558fd98861> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "slop.toml's [verify].include is widened from [\"src\", \"../slop-rdf\"] to [\"src\", \"src/rules\", \"../slop-rdf\"], bringing the OWL 2 RL rule modules under src/rules/ into the Z3 contract-verification pass for the first time — previously verify only reached files directly under src/, so per-function @pre/@post contracts in the five rule modules (cax/cls/eq/prp/scm) were never checked by `slop verify` despite the project's design-by-contract discipline. Evidence: commit 2bd3333 (subject \"verifies!\") diff hunk on slop.toml, [verify] section only." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8fef3fb8-4281-4f7a-90f3-66558fd98861> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8fef3fb8-4281-4f7a-90f3-66558fd98861> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-01-27T07:29:22Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
