<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/936b0242-4d2d-4a63-ab18-cc1487241b43> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-02-08T06:51:50Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
