<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/936b0242-4d2d-4a63-ab18-cc1487241b43> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#isSupersededBy> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e29c9f97-b319-4a33-9c05-e4db792389b4> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/936b0242-4d2d-4a63-ab18-cc1487241b43> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#supersedes> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2dedc0f9-53f1-4331-afd1-da069c898528> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/9649bceb-e2c6-460a-a823-c5313cdb89b9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/9649bceb-e2c6-460a-a823-c5313cdb89b9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CLI wires --quiet to engine's verbose timing via reason-with-config" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/9649bceb-e2c6-460a-a823-c5313cdb89b9> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/9f7a7679-6c17-40b2-bbef-b78d9832bfa1> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/9649bceb-e2c6-460a-a823-c5313cdb89b9> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/e71422b6-0c80-4741-aa68-a27243061168> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/9649bceb-e2c6-460a-a823-c5313cdb89b9> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/9649bceb-e2c6-460a-a823-c5313cdb89b9> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "cli/main.slop now calls `reason-with-config` — not the simpler `reason` entry point it called before — passing an explicitly constructed `ReasonerConfig`, so the CLI's existing `--quiet` flag now also suppresses the engine's new per-rule-group verbose timing output (see \"Config-gated per-rule-group timing replaces raw memory debug prints\"), not just the CLI's own parse/reason phase summary.\n\nWhy + evidence: commit d9ac429913 (\"print timing info\") diff on cli/main.slop — the import list changes from `(import growl (reason ReasonerResult ReasonerSuccess InconsistencyReport get-inferred-count))` to `(import growl (reason reason-with-config ReasonerConfig ReasonerResult ReasonerSuccess InconsistencyReport get-inferred-count default-config))`, and the reasoner-invocation site changes from `(match (reason arena ig) ...)` to `(let ((config (record-new ReasonerConfig (worker-count 4) (channel-buffer 256) (max-iterations 1000) (verbose (not quiet))))) (match (reason-with-config arena ig config) ...))` — hand-duplicating default-config's worker-count/channel-buffer/max-iterations values so it can override only `verbose`." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/9649bceb-e2c6-460a-a823-c5313cdb89b9> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/9649bceb-e2c6-460a-a823-c5313cdb89b9> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-02-07T00:39:15Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
