<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/bafb2a7c-bddb-4435-8af6-d8dd486b144f> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/365040dc-aee8-456c-936c-47a7dbb4c79b> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
