<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/bdafea78-7055-451a-a7ef-0e1e60f13488> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "cli/main.slop's ig-to-graph and cli/tests/test-cli.slop's equivalent helper now build a Graph directly via `(record-new Graph (triples (. ig triples)) (size (cast GraphSize (indexed-graph-size ig))))`, instead of looping over the IndexedGraph's triples with `make-graph` + `for-each` + `graph-add`. Evidence: commit 10f2845884 diff on both cli/main.slop and cli/tests/test-cli.slop — the identical `(let ((mut g (make-graph arena))) (for-each (t (. ig triples)) (set! g (graph-add arena g t))) g)` pattern is replaced with the record-new form in both files, and rdf's export list is extended with `GraphSize` for the cast to compile." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/bdafea78-7055-451a-a7ef-0e1e60f13488> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/bdafea78-7055-451a-a7ef-0e1e60f13488> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-02-07T04:53:15Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
