<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d5a2c63d-8f7f-4013-959a-c3f88e2adf8c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/833a482a-9217-4511-99e7-1166a8c28fbb> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d5a2c63d-8f7f-4013-959a-c3f88e2adf8c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d5a2c63d-8f7f-4013-959a-c3f88e2adf8c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Growl's Rust crate now vendors its C build sources into rust/csrc/ (src/ and runtime/) via a new Makefile `crate-vendor` target — copying csrc/src/*.c, csrc/src/*.h, csrc/runtime/slop_runtime.h, and LICENSE into rust/ — before `crate-build`/`crate-test`/`crate-publish` invoke cargo, rather than the crate's build script compiling C sources directly from the parent repo's csrc/ outside the crate's own directory tree. rust/csrc/ (and target/) are added to .gitignore, so the vendored copy is treated as a regenerable build artifact, not a second checked-in source of truth. A new `crate-publish` target runs `cd rust && cargo publish --dry-run --allow-dirty` after vendoring.\n\nWhy + evidence: commit 390247b3a9's first PR commit is titled \"cratify\"; the Makefile diff widens .PHONY with crate-vendor/crate-build/crate-test/crate-publish and adds the four targets (crate-vendor's recipe copies csrc/src and csrc/runtime/slop_runtime.h into rust/csrc/, plus LICENSE into rust/LICENSE; crate-build/crate-test/crate-publish each depend on crate-vendor); .gitignore adds `target/` and `rust/csrc`. Plausibly this vendoring step exists because `cargo publish` requires a crate's packaged build inputs to live inside the crate's own directory tree, which compiling directly from the parent repo's csrc/ (the prior arrangement per \"Add safe Rust bindings crate for growl\") would not satisfy." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d5a2c63d-8f7f-4013-959a-c3f88e2adf8c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "superseded" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d5a2c63d-8f7f-4013-959a-c3f88e2adf8c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-02-17T06:03:03Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
