<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e29c9f97-b319-4a33-9c05-e4db792389b4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "dt-type2 literal typing in Complete Mode" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e29c9f97-b319-4a33-9c05-e4db792389b4> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/365040dc-aee8-456c-936c-47a7dbb4c79b> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e29c9f97-b319-4a33-9c05-e4db792389b4> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/e71422b6-0c80-4741-aa68-a27243061168> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e29c9f97-b319-4a33-9c05-e4db792389b4> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e29c9f97-b319-4a33-9c05-e4db792389b4> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Growl now implements dt-type2 (asserts `literal rdf:type datatype` for every typed literal with a supported datatype), gated behind the existing opt-in `--complete`/`-c` flag alongside cls-thing, cls-nothing1, and prp-ap. OWL 2 RL rule coverage moves from 75/78 (96%) to 76/78 (97%); Table 8 (dt-*) moves from 2/5 to 3/5.\n\nWhy + evidence: commit d54cf78 (merge PR #7 from Trivyn/dttype2, \"Fixing up rust wrapper\"). README.md's Rule Coverage summary changes \"75 of 78 OWL 2 RL rules implemented (96% coverage)\" -> \"76 of 78 ... (97% coverage)\"; the Table 8 summary row 2/5 -> 3/5. A new Complete Mode bullet is added: \"- **dt-type2**: Asserts `literal rdf:type datatype` for every typed literal with a supported datatype\". The detailed Table 8 section changes \"dt-type2 | ❌ | Literal typing — non-standard literal-as-subject triples\" to \"dt-type2 | ✅ | Literal typing — asserts `literal rdf:type datatype` (behind `--complete` flag)\". Confirmed in source at HEAD: src/rules/dt.slop:158 defines `(fn dt-type2 ((arena Arena) (g IndexedGraph)) ...)` with doc comment \"For each typed literal ... if dt is a supported datatype, assert (\\\"lex\\\"^^dt rdf:type dt)\", wired into src/engine.slop:621-622 under a \"dt-type2: assert literal rdf:type datatype for typed literals\" comment." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e29c9f97-b319-4a33-9c05-e4db792389b4> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e29c9f97-b319-4a33-9c05-e4db792389b4> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasRationale> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/1179d4ae-d02c-4c63-9ab8-0de8c869205e> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
