<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e46eaabd-220e-435c-81cd-04ae13f7017d> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Source Makefile GROWL_VERSION default from slop.toml" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e46eaabd-220e-435c-81cd-04ae13f7017d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/74af8f69-d68a-4db6-a495-07bb196e4866> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e46eaabd-220e-435c-81cd-04ae13f7017d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/b44c8fa6-048b-4f14-b9ec-ecfa5010e5a0> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e46eaabd-220e-435c-81cd-04ae13f7017d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e46eaabd-220e-435c-81cd-04ae13f7017d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "growl's root Makefile no longer hardcodes GROWL_VERSION's default to the literal \"0.1.0\"; instead it derives the default via `$(shell sed -n 's/^version = \"\\(.*\\)\"/\\1/p' slop.toml | head -1)`, reading the version straight out of slop.toml's [project] section (currently \"0.7.0\"), with a new comment noting it can still be overridden via `make GROWL_VERSION=x.y.z`. This replaces the static placeholder default introduced by the original --version work (see \"CLI --version flag sourced from release-tag-derived GROWL_VERSION\") for ad-hoc/local builds, while leaving the tag-triggered release workflow's explicit `make release GROWL_VERSION=$VERSION` override untouched.\n\nWhy + evidence: commit 19d065eac6 (\"Makefile fix\") diff on Makefile — `GROWL_VERSION ?= 0.1.0` is replaced by `GROWL_VERSION ?= $(shell sed -n 's/^version = \"\\(.*\\)\"/\\1/p' slop.toml | head -1)`, preceded by the comment \"Version is sourced from slop.toml [project]; override with `make GROWL_VERSION=x.y.z`\"." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e46eaabd-220e-435c-81cd-04ae13f7017d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
