<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/f369f216-61e5-4e64-ae90-60f12b474c14> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/e71422b6-0c80-4741-aa68-a27243061168> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/f369f216-61e5-4e64-ae90-60f12b474c14> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/f369f216-61e5-4e64-ae90-60f12b474c14> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "ReasonerConfig gains a new `max-triples (Int 0 ..)` field (default 0 = no limit); engine-run's main fixpoint loop and engine-schema-materialize's phase-3 (transitive-closure) block each check it — once per iteration / once after TC — and if the graph's triple count exceeds the configured limit, they set the same `done`/`cancelled` flags the existing cancel-ptr check uses, halting reasoning early and returning via the same sound-partial-result path (reason-cancelled) as cooperative cancellation, rather than erroring or continuing to grow the graph unbounded.\n\nWhy + evidence: commit cd0f8210dd (#19, \"Improvements for memory usage\") diff on src/types.slop (ReasonerConfig gains `(max-triples (Int 0 ..))`), src/engine.slop (engine-run's while-loop gains a `(when (and (> (. config max-triples) 0) (> (indexed-graph-size (. state graph)) (. config max-triples))) (do ... (set! done true) (set! cancelled true)))` block right after the existing cancel-ptr atomic check, and engine-schema-materialize gains an equivalent check \"after TC (most likely blowup point)\" that instead does `(return graph)`), src/growl.slop (default-config sets max-triples to 0), cli/main.slop (new `--max-triples N` flag parsed via strlib's parse-int and threaded into the ReasonerConfig), README.md (documents the field/flag), and rust/src/ffi.rs + rust/src/lib.rs (ReasonerConfigFfi gains `max_triples: i64`; `ReasonerConfig::max_triples(n)` builder method, doc comment \"When the graph exceeds this limit during reasoning, the reasoner stops and returns `Cancelled` with partial results\")." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/f369f216-61e5-4e64-ae90-60f12b474c14> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/f369f216-61e5-4e64-ae90-60f12b474c14> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-04-13T03:04:30Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
