<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/f369f216-61e5-4e64-ae90-60f12b474c14> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#resultsIn> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/95fb64cf-0ba3-4f24-9192-30608b3983b6> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fa819b9d-6bdb-483f-aa99-0e6e59058bf8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fa819b9d-6bdb-483f-aa99-0e6e59058bf8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Add safe Rust bindings crate for growl" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fa819b9d-6bdb-483f-aa99-0e6e59058bf8> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/833a482a-9217-4511-99e7-1166a8c28fbb> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fa819b9d-6bdb-483f-aa99-0e6e59058bf8> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/9f7a7679-6c17-40b2-bbef-b78d9832bfa1> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fa819b9d-6bdb-483f-aa99-0e6e59058bf8> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fa819b9d-6bdb-483f-aa99-0e6e59058bf8> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Growl gains an official Rust crate providing a safe wrapper over its existing C-ABI reasoner, rather than leaving Rust consumers to hand-write their own FFI. The crate's build.rs uses the `cc` crate to compile growl's pre-transpiled C sources (19 files from csrc/src/) plus a new csrc_shim.c directly into the crate, instead of linking a prebuilt libgrowl.a — so no SLOP toolchain is needed to consume growl from Rust. Evidence: commit b71011547e (merge PR #6, \"Rusty\") adds rust/Cargo.toml (path-dependency crate \"growl\"), rust/build.rs (cc::Build over the 19 csrc/src/*.c files + csrc_shim.c), rust/src/ffi.rs (raw extern \"C\" declarations mirroring growl.h/slop_runtime.h types), rust/src/lib.rs (Arena/IndexedGraph/Term/Triple/ReasonerConfig safe wrappers and reason()/reason_with_config()/is_consistent()/get_types()/get_same_as()), and rust/README.md documenting the API and a Quick Start example." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fa819b9d-6bdb-483f-aa99-0e6e59058bf8> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fa819b9d-6bdb-483f-aa99-0e6e59058bf8> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-02-09T00:26:48Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
