<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/0cce7922-e498-4c56-bdf8-bc01db48197d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/0cce7922-e498-4c56-bdf8-bc01db48197d> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Per-loop @loop-invariant soundness annotations on cax-sco, cax-eqc1, cax-eqc2, and cls-hv1 were deleted rather than restated against the callback form, since indexed-graph-for-each's callback has no site to express a per-iteration @loop-invariant — Z3-verified soundness coverage for those four rules is reduced." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
