<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/17e0af19-2201-4730-a97b-053446bea4a4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Every existing ReasonerResult consumer must add a third match arm for reason-cancelled or fail match completeness, since the union grew from 2 to 3 variants — evidenced by cli/main.slop's new [CANCELLED] report branch and README's documented match snippet both gaining a ((reason-cancelled _) ...) arm alongside the pre-existing reason-success/reason-inconsistent arms." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
