<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/296c4a7b-5f50-43c5-a292-c7feeb94bf67> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/296c4a7b-5f50-43c5-a292-c7feeb94bf67> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "IndexedGraph's memory footprint drops because its spo/pso/osp leaf-level sets no longer store a duplicate copy of the two already-known triple positions for every entry — only the differentiating third term is kept — at the cost that every match/contains/for-each callback now reconstructs the Triple struct on the fly from the two outer map keys plus the leaf term, instead of reading a verbatim stored Triple." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/296c4a7b-5f50-43c5-a292-c7feeb94bf67> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/296c4a7b-5f50-43c5-a292-c7feeb94bf67> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/296c4a7b-5f50-43c5-a292-c7feeb94bf67> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-04-13T03:04:30Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/296c4a7b-5f50-43c5-a292-c7feeb94bf67> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "IndexedGraph's memory footprint drops because its spo/pso/osp leaf-level sets no longer store a duplicate copy of the two already-known triple positions for every entry — only the differentiating third term is kept — at the cost that every match/contains/for-each callback now reconstructs the Triple struct on the fly from the two outer map keys plus the leaf term, instead of reading a verbatim stored Triple." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/2d7b91c8-4a0a-484c-8145-b1eee40760ba> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/2d7b91c8-4a0a-484c-8145-b1eee40760ba> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Release binaries built by the tag-triggered GitHub Actions pipeline now report the exact v* tag they were released under via `growl --version`, but local/manual builds silently default to the placeholder \"0.1.0\" unless GROWL_VERSION is passed explicitly on the `make` command line, so an ad-hoc build can report a misleading version string." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/2d7b91c8-4a0a-484c-8145-b1eee40760ba> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
