<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/3d3f8396-7bbe-4375-b24e-11e875d8fb59> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Ad-hoc/local `make` invocations that don't pass GROWL_VERSION explicitly now report the version string read live from slop.toml's [project] section, rather than a hardcoded \"0.1.0\" placeholder, so `growl --version` output for local/manual builds stays accurate without requiring the tag-derived CI override." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
