<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/535cc8ea-1109-4f97-9b6a-b7a14969d03a> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The long-lived engine arena no longer permanently retains a full duplicate-as-delta copy of the graph for every schema-materialization phase or for engine_engine_run's initial/fixpoint delta setup — that scratch memory is freed once each phase/setup step finishes, reducing peak/retained arena memory during reasoning relative to the prior single-arena scheme." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
