<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/64719229-d028-4ab0-a82f-96941aafb104> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/64719229-d028-4ab0-a82f-96941aafb104> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "12 coordinator-owned 1MB arenas, sub-divided within rule groups, per parallel iteration" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/64719229-d028-4ab0-a82f-96941aafb104> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/64719229-d028-4ab0-a82f-96941aafb104> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "apply-all-rules-parallel now allocates and frees 12 coordinator-owned 1MB arenas per parallel iteration — one per semantic sub-worker — instead of 5 (one per rule group). Each rule group (scm, cax, prp, eq, cls) is split across 2-3 of these arenas rather than owning a single shared arena for all of its rule functions. Evidence: src/engine.slop diff in commit 10f2845884 replacing the 5 `(arena-new 1048576)` bindings and their matching `arena-free` calls with 12, and threading the 12 arenas as separate parameters through spawn-rule-workers." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/64719229-d028-4ab0-a82f-96941aafb104> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/64719229-d028-4ab0-a82f-96941aafb104> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasRationale> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/2afc6997-2cd9-4b47-812c-e08279add5bc> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
