<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/64719229-d028-4ab0-a82f-96941aafb104> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "12 coordinator-owned 1MB arenas, sub-divided within rule groups, per parallel iteration" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
