<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/68f81c10-35f3-4a1a-a467-3172c361372f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/68f81c10-35f3-4a1a-a467-3172c361372f> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bound-object (or bound-predicate, for subjects()) lookups in rdf_indexed_graph_match/for_each/subjects turn from an O(leaf-set-size) linear scan with an rdf_term_eq filter into an O(1) hash-map lookup, since the leaf is now itself a map keyed by the very term being searched for." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
