<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/68f81c10-35f3-4a1a-a467-3172c361372f> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Bound-object (or bound-predicate, for subjects()) lookups in rdf_indexed_graph_match/for_each/subjects turn from an O(leaf-set-size) linear scan with an rdf_term_eq filter into an O(1) hash-map lookup, since the leaf is now itself a map keyed by the very term being searched for." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/6b7e7826-989e-4cf4-b259-d7448d8d9a96> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/6b7e7826-989e-4cf4-b259-d7448d8d9a96> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Every rule module now depends on Delta's by-predicate index staying in sync with delta.triples/seen inside delta-add; a future delta-construction path that populates triples without also indexing by-predicate would silently miss matches for the affected predicate." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
