<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/6e6ddfe1-247c-4646-9b04-069dfd400f0b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Default behavior is unchanged: ReasonerConfig.fast defaults to false and the CLI requires --fast/-f explicitly, so existing callers of default-config or reason (without an explicit config) still get full OWL 2 RL closure as before." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
