<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7a17bb20-0b9c-4253-ae9d-ce02cb1340cf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7a17bb20-0b9c-4253-ae9d-ce02cb1340cf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Parallel worker infrastructure wired into main loop" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7a17bb20-0b9c-4253-ae9d-ce02cb1340cf> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7a17bb20-0b9c-4253-ae9d-ce02cb1340cf> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "spawn-rule-workers and collect-worker-results are now invoked from apply-all-rules-parallel, itself dispatched from apply-all-rules whenever (. config worker-count) > 1 and (. delta iteration) != 0 — engine-run-iteration no longer always takes a single-threaded path. Evidence: src/engine.slop diff replaces the \"Rule Application (Single-Threaded Path)\" section header with \"Rule Application: Dispatch\", adds apply-all-rules-parallel, and rewrites spawn-rule-workers to take five coordinator-owned per-rule-group arenas instead of a single shared arena." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7a17bb20-0b9c-4253-ae9d-ce02cb1340cf> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
