<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7a17bb20-0b9c-4253-ae9d-ce02cb1340cf> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-02-06T04:49:33Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7a17bb20-0b9c-4253-ae9d-ce02cb1340cf> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Parallel worker infrastructure wired into main loop" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7a17bb20-0b9c-4253-ae9d-ce02cb1340cf> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#resultsFrom> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/46b6eb2f-386e-47d1-82f6-6aed459402e6> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
