<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/a9670bca-b5b8-4137-b231-505d0643d52f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/a9670bca-b5b8-4137-b231-505d0643d52f> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Regenerating csrc/'s C sources after editing a .slop file still requires SLOP_HOME and the native slop-compiler binary, via csrc/generate_c.py; the checked-in C is now a second source of truth that must be kept in sync with the .slop originals." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
