<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/af153b24-5236-409f-b12b-562ab6ed90b1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Compiling or testing growl now requires a SLOP_HOME environment variable pointing at a slop toolchain installation providing lib/std, alongside the sibling ../slop-rdf checkout, for standard-library imports to resolve." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
