<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/b4e4407f-4089-4538-be61-33a5074d7cf2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The eq-infer, eq-check, cls-set, and cls-ind parallel-worker arenas shrink from 1MB to 64 bytes each under --enrich (mirroring the existing fast-mode eq-check shrink), since engine.slop's spawn-rule-workers skips spawning those workers entirely when enrich is set." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
