<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/b60d9cc3-3836-4d8c-9c71-94f6bceb4bfa> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/b60d9cc3-3836-4d8c-9c71-94f6bceb4bfa> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Fork-join parallel worker infrastructure (spawn-rule-workers / collect-worker-results / WorkerMessage channel protocol) is scaffolded in engine.slop but not wired into the main loop: engine-run-iteration currently calls apply-all-rules directly on a single thread ('Single-Threaded Path' comment), despite the module doc titling the file 'Parallel Fixpoint Rule Evaluation'. Parallelism is deferred to a later commit." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/b60d9cc3-3836-4d8c-9c71-94f6bceb4bfa> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
