<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/b60d9cc3-3836-4d8c-9c71-94f6bceb4bfa> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#isSupersededBy> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7a17bb20-0b9c-4253-ae9d-ce02cb1340cf> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
