<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/c1315e16-f15d-423d-bfc7-56235eeacfee> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Users and the benchmark/test harness now get file line/column context on TTL syntax errors instead of only the bare input path, but a generic file-level error (file-error) still reports no further detail beyond '(file error)'." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
