<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/c5645040-9d1a-4f49-9ab8-8dec864a4c32> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/c5645040-9d1a-4f49-9ab8-8dec864a4c32> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Fast mode trades OWL 2 RL soundness/completeness for speed: schema closure (scm-*) and several consistency/cardinality checks are not derived or enforced when --fast is set, so results may differ from full-profile reasoning on ontologies that rely on inferred (rather than explicit) subClassOf/subPropertyOf chains, or that would otherwise trigger the skipped disjointness/functional-property/cardinality violations." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/c5645040-9d1a-4f49-9ab8-8dec864a4c32> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
