<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/c829b5bd-8338-4d20-91e4-9e992ff089f7> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "include/growl.h becomes a second source of truth that must be kept in sync with the SLOP-generated build/growl.h via `make slop-build`, the same checked-in-generated-artifact trade-off already accepted for csrc/'s C sources (see \"Toolchain-free C build for growl\")." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
