<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/ca742dbb-57b5-4fba-930e-e3ff927faab6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Producing build/libgrowl.a via `make lib` no longer requires the SLOP toolchain or a slop-compiler installation, mirroring the existing toolchain-free `make cli`/`make test`/`make release` targets." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
