<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/dcd7858d-e5fa-4339-8f79-d43f9cda594f> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Every Delta this function returns now has a permanently-empty seen set, so any code path that inspects an initial delta's seen set for dedup purposes (rather than treating the delta as purely additive input to the first rule-application round) would silently miss entries that a delta-add-populated seen set would have recorded." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
