<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/df25f82f-add2-4703-afec-a8ad6ca99982> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Full `slop verify` over src/ under 0.3.0 crashes the verifier in src/rules/scm.slop (Z3Exception 'Overflow encountered when expanding vector' after ~35 min). This is a verifier-side failure, not a growl contract violation. It is not yet known whether 0.2.x also failed there." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
