<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/e5447226-4d4d-4d30-8871-18feaf41f12b> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "owl:Thing membership is not materialized for every resource (cls-thing skipped), avoiding triple-count explosion at the cost of not deriving explicit rdf:type owl:Thing triples that some consumers might expect." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
