<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/eeca1158-99ca-4478-82bd-0fad190c57b6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/eeca1158-99ca-4478-82bd-0fad190c57b6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "delta-add's by-predicate insertion path now performs at most one map lookup plus one map insert per triple (the insert only on a predicate's first occurrence), instead of an unconditional map-has check, an unconditional map-put of an empty set on every call, and a separate map-get -- removing a redundant hash-map operation from the hot insert path." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/eeca1158-99ca-4478-82bd-0fad190c57b6> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
