<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/efa7d6e1-0a5a-4aac-8233-3a5bafbff676> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
