<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/efa7d6e1-0a5a-4aac-8233-3a5bafbff676> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
