<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/fc50222b-7d70-4131-837d-ea33d5f6eed6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Enrich mode depends on the input ontology already having explicit subClassOf/subPropertyOf chains stated, since scm-* schema closure does not run under --enrich -- per the README, it is 'a good fit when your ontology already has explicit subClassOf/subPropertyOf chains (most published ontologies do)', not a substitute for schema materialization." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
