<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/eaf0f55f-4d1d-4f41-96fb-d9b5a51b1aae> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Constraint> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
