<https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/833a482a-9217-4511-99e7-1166a8c28fbb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Safe Rust wrapper crate (rust/) over growl's C-ABI reasoner: RAII Arena, IndexedGraph, Term/Triple views, ReasonerConfig builder, and reason()/reason_with_config()/is_consistent()/get_types()/get_same_as() free functions, plus a raw ffi module of extern \"C\" bindings. Built via build.rs (the `cc` crate) compiling the vendored csrc/ sources and a new csrc_shim.c directly — no SLOP toolchain required. Evidence: commit b71011547e (merge PR #6, \"Rusty\") adds rust/Cargo.toml, rust/build.rs, rust/csrc_shim.c, rust/src/ffi.rs, rust/src/lib.rs, rust/README.md in full." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
