<https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/e71422b6-0c80-4741-aa68-a27243061168> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasComponentName> "Growl CLI" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/e71422b6-0c80-4741-aa68-a27243061168> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "A standalone command-line executable (cli/main.slop) that wraps the growl reasoner library: parses a TTL file, runs the OWL 2 RL reasoner, reports [PASS]/[FAIL] consistency with inferred-triple/iteration counts, and optionally emits the materialized graph to TTL via --emit. Built as a separate slop project (cli/slop.toml, type=\"executable\") alongside its own integration test suite (cli/tests/). Evidence: commit c12cd0ed (\"getting bfo test working\") adds cli/main.slop, cli/slop.toml, and cli/tests/ in full." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
